.gsd/milestones/M001/M001-CONTEXT.md:10:This milestone initializes the new `.gsd/` project state from the old pre-fork `getting-shit-done` archive in `.planning/`. The user wants **current truth**, not a full archive conversion. `.planning/` has been backed up and can be consulted later if needed.
